text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          Is this all just illusion?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b;font-size:20px\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        When the red sun set with<br>In the crowd of peoples coming home with cheers<br>Silver moon rises in the vent of<br>The tree shedding leaves     <br>This street with the shade of amber light<br>Calm, Dreambound<br>With the game between light and dark<br>starts the quiet night This dew wet soft sky                                       <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b;font-size:20px\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">All is just illusion. Just illusion.   <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"background-color:#eeff5b;font-size:20px\" class=\"has-text-color has-background has-black-color wp-block-paragraph\">-Rahi<\/p>\n\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lost in a distant region Chapter # 0116\/04\/2020Ancient Lullaby Are You a monster? Are you a freak? Will you be my fri